// include: hosts
// Test only, never shipped in a workbook: the shared Hosts table with every column the classification assertions read.
// The grids show a short selection of these columns; the logic being tested lives in the shared fragment, not in the projection.
Hosts
| sort by Rank asc, Machine asc
| project Machine, Topology, Os, Application, Environment, State = ReportingState, Assessment, Evidence = EvidenceState,
    CpuP95 = round(CpuP95, 1), CpuPeak = round(CpuMax, 0), Pattern,
    MemP95 = round(MemP95, 1), MemPeak = round(MemMax, 1), AvailMbMin = round(AvailMbMin, 0), FreePct = round(DiskFreeNowPct, 1), Volume = DiskWorstVolume,
    History = EvidenceNote, LastSample = HostLastSeen, AgeMinutes, Reason
